# 從頭再嚟
(pos:成語/短語)
<explanation>
yue:由開始重新做過一次；放棄之前嘅努力，重新開始。
eng:to start over; to begin again from the beginning
<eg>
yue:呢個項目失敗咗，我哋決定從頭再嚟。 (zi4 tung4 coi4 lei4. ni4 go3 zung6 muk6 sit1 baai3 zo2, ngo5 deng6 syut3 ding6 zi4 tung4 coi4 lei4.)
eng:The project failed, so we decided to start over. [end of text]


